WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.920
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:04.650
<i>Wow! A gift for you!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.520
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:11.930 --> 00:13.710
<i>Nothing happening,</i>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.910
<i>every day feels the same</i>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
<i>Over and over, just</i>

00:17.320 --> 00:19.400
<i>waiting for time to pass</i>

00:19.400 --> 00:21.420
<i>When I'm with you,</i>

00:21.420 --> 00:22.620
<i>I can feel</i>

00:22.620 --> 00:24.750
<i>something so special,</i>

00:24.750 --> 00:27.880
<i>and I want to make it real</i>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.380
<i>Look, I'm really grateful every day, but you know</i>

00:30.380 --> 00:32.270
<i>I feel like I'm not doing enough in return</i>

00:32.270 --> 00:33.920
<i>"I was just feeling like it.</i>

00:33.920 --> 00:35.720
<i>No real meaning or reason why."</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:40.110
<i>Stop complaining and just take it already!</i>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
<i>Yeah, there's no way that's how it goes!</i>

00:42.680 --> 00:44.320
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:44.320 --> 00:46.360
<i>Whoa oh oh oh oh</i>

00:46.360 --> 00:48.810
<i>An angel just landed</i>

00:48.810 --> 00:50.700
<i>Right in front of me</i>

00:50.700 --> 00:52.320
<i>With a smile that looked</i>

00:52.320 --> 00:53.990
<i>Like her wings spreading open</i>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.950
<i>Hey, that's against all the rules</i>

00:55.950 --> 00:57.360
<i>You look so happy</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>Wipe off that look</i>

00:59.290 --> 01:01.180
<i>Before my mind goes blank</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:03.020
<i>If you keep this up,</i>

01:03.020 --> 01:05.640
<i>You're gonna spoil me rotten</i>

01:06.460 --> 01:09.760
<i>Come on, you gotta do something about this</i>

01:08.220 --> 01:10.480
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:10.480 --> 01:11.610
<i>I want to know</i>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.640
<i>A lot more about</i>

01:13.640 --> 01:15.680
<i>The world you live in</i>

01:15.680 --> 01:17.880
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:17.880 --> 01:18.910
<i>I want to laugh</i>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.890
<i>A lot more with you</i>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.050
<i>In the world you live in</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:26.640
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

01:23.050 --> 01:25.020
<i>I want to know more</i>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.690
<i>I want to laugh more</i>

01:31.200 --> 01:33.930
So anyway, I need your advice.

01:33.930 --> 01:36.650
February has that one 
really important event, right?

01:37.040 --> 01:38.530
You mean final exams?

01:38.530 --> 01:39.300
Huh?

01:40.030 --> 01:44.910
Hey, how come a shining example of a high 
school boy has such a downer of an answer?

01:45.320 --> 01:48.200
I don't know if high school boys shine or not,

01:48.200 --> 01:50.920
but that's the first thing 
most students would think of.

01:50.920 --> 01:55.010
Any boy blooming in the springtime 
of youth would say Valentine's Day!

01:55.550 --> 01:57.930
I guess I'm not blooming enough to know.

02:00.360 --> 02:02.300
I wonder about that.

02:04.100 --> 02:05.060
So?

02:05.980 --> 02:07.480
What did you want to ask?

02:07.940 --> 02:12.240
Well, I was wondering 
what kind of chocolates to give Ikkun.

02:12.240 --> 02:15.960
In middle school, I just made him 
the melt-and-mold kind,

02:15.960 --> 02:19.700
but now that we're in high school, 
I want to make something more special.

02:19.960 --> 02:22.990
Then Shiina would have 
better ideas than I would.

02:22.990 --> 02:24.750
I plan to ask Mahiru,

02:24.750 --> 02:29.260
but you happen to be a boy, 
so I thought I should ask you, too.

02:29.260 --> 02:32.500
I don't "happen" to be. 
I'm a certified, genuine guy.

02:33.400 --> 02:37.400
I think a genuine guy would put moves 
on a girl when they're alone together.

02:45.710 --> 02:49.600
Come on, that's something you negotiate 
with someone when you're dating.

02:50.040 --> 02:52.860
And we're not even in that
 kind of relationship.

02:53.150 --> 02:54.820
Amane, wow.

02:54.820 --> 02:58.070
Sometimes you sound like you were
 really raised well. Sensible, like.

02:58.980 --> 03:03.420
<i>I'd be lying if I said Mahiru 
doesn't trigger some urges in me,</i>

03:04.800 --> 03:09.580
<i>but I never once thought of 
doing something stupid because of it.</i>

03:11.090 --> 03:13.930
<i>I don't want to make her cry or hate me.</i>

03:14.360 --> 03:18.310
<i>That's what always comes first 
when I think about Mahiru.</i>

03:19.010 --> 03:24.010
A Gift from the Angel

03:26.310 --> 03:30.170
Oh, I'm giving you chocolate, too, Amane.

03:30.170 --> 03:31.420
What kind do you like?

03:31.420 --> 03:34.360
I don't really care either way about sweets.

03:35.000 --> 03:36.690
Maybe something that isn't too sweet.

03:36.690 --> 03:38.940
Something not too sweet, huh?

03:38.940 --> 03:41.520
Got it! I'll try all sorts of things.

03:41.520 --> 03:43.320
Don't contaminate it with anything weird!

03:43.680 --> 03:46.620
Oh, don't worry! I promise it'll be edible.

03:47.020 --> 03:48.450
Oh, come on.

03:48.720 --> 03:51.340
Mahiru, is there anyone 
you're giving chocolate to?

03:51.340 --> 03:53.830
Just the girls in class I'm friends with.

03:54.400 --> 03:56.170
Not to any boys?

03:57.780 --> 04:01.090
If I did, their responses 
would get out of hand.

04:01.090 --> 04:02.750
Oh.

04:02.750 --> 04:04.540
But you'll get some, Chitose-san.

04:04.540 --> 04:06.600
Yay! You're the best!

04:06.990 --> 04:11.230
I'll give you some, too! 
Real ones, not like the ones for Amane.

04:11.230 --> 04:12.180
I heard that.

04:12.730 --> 04:14.350
I'm just kidding!

04:14.350 --> 04:17.270
I'll give you ones that are edible.

04:17.270 --> 04:21.440
I get the feeling "edible" and "good" 
are two very different things.

04:21.970 --> 04:23.800
You just wait and see!

04:36.150 --> 04:38.000
Kadowaki-kun, here!

04:38.490 --> 04:40.280
You know I really mean it.

04:40.280 --> 04:43.340
Hey! Mine are from the heart, too!

04:43.340 --> 04:46.680
Kadowaki-kun, my chocolate is sincere, too.

04:47.120 --> 04:49.430
Yeah. Thanks, everyone.

04:49.960 --> 04:51.910
Hey, eat mine first!

04:51.910 --> 04:53.200
Don't be rude!

04:53.200 --> 04:54.180
Mine first!

04:54.180 --> 04:55.420
Try mine!

04:55.420 --> 04:58.080
Geez, man. Would you look at that?

04:58.080 --> 05:00.110
I guess that's what I expected.

05:00.110 --> 05:02.860
Check out the other guys' faces.

05:03.150 --> 05:05.240
I bet it's tough being that popular.

05:05.550 --> 05:08.700
And it's gotta be a pain 
to carry all that home.

05:08.700 --> 05:13.000
It's been like that since middle school. 
It's crazy he doesn't get fat from it.

05:13.290 --> 05:15.460
That's track club for you.

05:15.460 --> 05:19.440
But what do I know? I'd never get enough
 chocolate to make me fat.

05:19.440 --> 05:23.000
Hmm. But Chi's got something special for you.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.300
You'd better brace yourself.

05:24.730 --> 05:26.630
What do you mean, "brace myself"?

05:27.510 --> 05:28.890
"Russian chocolette."

05:28.890 --> 05:30.430
What the hell did she put in them?!

05:30.430 --> 05:34.480
One has the holy trinity of 
habanero, wasabi, and pepper.

05:34.480 --> 05:38.040
Another one has concentrated 
pickled plum extract jelly.

05:38.040 --> 05:40.180
The others are just chocolate, though.

05:41.700 --> 05:43.930
How can she make stuff like that?!

05:44.680 --> 05:48.860
Say, Amane-kun. Think you'll 
get any from <i>her</i>?

05:50.850 --> 05:51.870
Don't know.

05:52.250 --> 05:55.160
I don't have any reason to think so.

05:55.870 --> 05:58.370
<b>Seijo High School</b>

05:58.650 --> 06:01.120
Here, Amane! Enjoy.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.670
Thanks.

06:03.050 --> 06:06.630
Ikkun probably told you, 
but I think you'll like what's inside!

06:07.030 --> 06:10.590
You know, I'm not really into spicy stuff.

06:10.590 --> 06:13.680
Oh, there are some super-sweet 
and super-bitter ones, too.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.980
Thanks for the warning, at least.

06:17.980 --> 06:20.770
Chi... are you serious?

06:20.770 --> 06:24.190
It's totally fine! 
I know he'll get a palate cleanser.

06:24.190 --> 06:25.440
Palate cleanser?

06:26.000 --> 06:29.030
All right, we gotta go. Bye-bye!

06:30.530 --> 06:32.330
I'll pray for your survival.

06:32.330 --> 06:34.380
Ikkun, come on, come on!

06:39.620 --> 06:40.820
Kadowaki.

06:42.230 --> 06:44.810
Oh, Fujimiya. Is something up?

06:44.810 --> 06:47.070
Nothing important, really.

06:47.070 --> 06:47.670
Here.

06:47.980 --> 06:49.700
Huh? Oh.

06:50.190 --> 06:52.390
I keep it on me for shopping.

06:53.880 --> 06:54.970
Don't need it?

06:54.970 --> 06:57.520
N-No, I can use it.

06:58.040 --> 07:01.770
Cool. It won't be easy, but good luck.

07:16.040 --> 07:18.830
Did Chitose-san's Russian chocolette get you?

07:20.410 --> 07:23.670
Here I thought I'd be safe spreading 
them out over a few days.

07:23.670 --> 07:25.610
You have my condolences.

07:25.610 --> 07:30.400
If you think about it, if you pass through 
hell first, the rest should be heaven.

07:30.400 --> 07:33.220
Here, a palate cleanser.

07:33.220 --> 07:34.400
Cocoa?

07:34.400 --> 07:40.720
Close to that. It's chocolat chau... 
well, basically hot chocolate.

07:40.720 --> 07:41.940
You're a lifesaver!

07:45.510 --> 07:46.440
This is great!

07:48.030 --> 07:49.900
I'm glad you think so.

07:52.420 --> 07:55.740
This is unusual, though. 
Hot chocolate and stuff.

07:56.280 --> 07:58.290
Wouldn't you usually make hot milk?

07:58.720 --> 08:00.870
Well, I guess.

08:01.340 --> 08:05.430
Oh, did you make this 
because of Valentine's Day?

08:05.930 --> 08:06.790
I guess.

08:11.170 --> 08:13.320
Thank you. It really helps.

08:17.220 --> 08:18.310
That was delicious.

08:20.080 --> 08:21.370
Something wrong?

08:22.040 --> 08:24.140
Well, I just...

08:32.520 --> 08:34.170
I'm g-going home!

08:34.170 --> 08:34.820
Huh?

08:36.610 --> 08:38.900
<i>Did I say something wrong?</i>

08:48.960 --> 08:53.970
Thank you for always taking care of me.
Here is a token of my gratitude.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.930
<i>Thank you for always taking care of me.</i>

08:51.930 --> 08:53.970
<i>Here is a token of my gratitude.</i>

09:03.730 --> 09:05.350
It seems you don't really like sweet things, so I made something I thought you could eat. They're called orangettes. I hope you like them.

09:04.460 --> 09:10.190
<i>It seems you don't really like sweet things, 
so I made something I thought you could eat.</i>

09:10.190 --> 09:14.360
<i>They're called orangettes. 
I hope you like them.</i>

09:15.930 --> 09:18.700
I don't really care either way about sweets.

09:19.120 --> 09:21.200
Maybe something that isn't too sweet.

09:27.650 --> 09:28.680
<i>Mahiru.</i>

09:38.020 --> 09:39.220
<i>This is so good.</i>

09:40.470 --> 09:41.370
Good morning!

09:41.370 --> 09:41.930
Good morning!

09:41.930 --> 09:42.970
Hey, about yesterday...

09:44.000 --> 09:44.880
Fujimiya.

09:44.880 --> 09:45.350
Hmm?

09:46.070 --> 09:48.690
Kadowaki-kun talking to Fujimiya-kun?

09:49.040 --> 09:50.890
Did something happen?

09:50.890 --> 09:55.820
This is unusual. Fujimiya-kun usually 
only talks to Akazawa-kun.

09:56.250 --> 09:57.650
Thanks a ton for yesterday.

09:57.650 --> 10:00.460
Sure. It wasn't a big deal.

10:00.460 --> 10:01.780
You had a lot on your hands.

10:03.940 --> 10:04.750
Well, yeah.

10:05.640 --> 10:09.070
Anyway, that helped. 
I just wanted to say thanks.

10:09.070 --> 10:13.050
No problem. Gotta help 
each other out sometimes.

10:13.050 --> 10:14.090
Don't worry about it.

10:15.080 --> 10:15.960
Thanks, man.

10:18.760 --> 10:20.940
That was so charming!

10:20.940 --> 10:21.840
Amane.

10:21.840 --> 10:22.540
Hmm?

10:23.140 --> 10:25.350
Did you do something for Yuta?

10:25.780 --> 10:28.730
Kadowaki didn't know what to do 
with all the chocolate he got.

10:28.730 --> 10:31.440
I just lent him a plastic bag I had on me.

10:31.440 --> 10:34.760
Ah. I guess it was more than he expected.

10:34.760 --> 10:36.280
Should've come better prepared.

10:36.830 --> 10:39.900
But hey, carrying your own 
shopping bag around?

10:39.900 --> 10:41.910
You're all domesticated now, dude.

10:41.910 --> 10:45.080
Yeah, I wonder if it's someone's 
influence on me.

10:45.080 --> 10:47.930
Sure is nice to have 
a domestic partner, yeah?

10:47.930 --> 10:49.880
We aren't "partners," man.

10:50.390 --> 10:52.920
But what about Chitose? 
With chores and stuff?

10:52.920 --> 10:54.040
Chi?

10:54.640 --> 10:56.240
Yeah, hmm...

10:56.240 --> 10:59.390
As long as she doesn't get 
caught up in some wild idea...

10:59.390 --> 11:02.180
Yeah, chores aren't impossible.

11:02.180 --> 11:05.060
She doesn't go completely 
over the top with it?

11:06.630 --> 11:08.520
That's part of her charm, bro.

11:08.520 --> 11:10.490
Hey. Look me in the eye and say that.

11:10.490 --> 11:14.170
Well, I'm sure she'll figure it out 
once we get married.

11:14.170 --> 11:17.480
How much work is it gonna take 
to make your dad approve?

11:18.080 --> 11:19.980
That's pretty rare today.

11:19.980 --> 11:22.820
A parent complaining that much 
about someone you're dating.

11:23.150 --> 11:27.550
I don't think "His Highness" approved 
when I said we planned to marry.

11:27.550 --> 11:30.910
Well, once I get older, 
I'll slowly win him over.

11:31.360 --> 11:35.530
I fully expect you to hold firm 
until he gives in, but good luck.

11:35.530 --> 11:37.250
Sure! You too, bud.

11:38.790 --> 11:40.090
With what?

11:40.360 --> 11:42.800
You know, with <i>her</i>. Right?

11:43.910 --> 11:47.530
It's not like that between us.

11:48.010 --> 11:50.060
Fujimiya

12:01.430 --> 12:02.490
I'm home.

12:02.830 --> 12:04.280
Welcome back.

12:04.280 --> 12:06.350
Thanks for yesterday. It was delicious.

12:06.350 --> 12:08.380
I'm glad you thought so.

12:08.380 --> 12:09.870
What do you want in return?

12:10.200 --> 12:13.920
I didn't do it expecting 
to get something in return.

12:13.920 --> 12:16.210
Yeah, I know that.

12:16.210 --> 12:18.750
But I should return the sentiment, at least.

12:18.750 --> 12:21.420
I wouldn't be much of a man 
if I never repay you for things.

12:21.990 --> 12:25.680
You've given me a lot of things already.

12:25.680 --> 12:29.200
I still think you do more 
for me all the time.

12:29.200 --> 12:34.010
All of your cooking and stuff. 
You're always taking care of me.

12:34.010 --> 12:37.420
I do all of that because I want to.

12:38.060 --> 12:41.820
I don't think you realize 
all that you do for me.

12:42.560 --> 12:46.240
I'm definitely aware of it, though, so it's okay.

12:46.620 --> 12:49.340
But that's one thing. This is different.

12:49.800 --> 12:52.500
Anyway, I'll try to think of 
something you'd like.

12:53.780 --> 12:54.960
Okay.

12:54.960 --> 12:58.430
Just don't get your hopes up too high.

12:58.430 --> 13:03.260
Okay, but I treasure everything 
that you've given me.

13:03.260 --> 13:04.970
Come on, you're exaggerating.

13:05.570 --> 13:08.010
I take good care of Mr. Bear, too.

13:08.410 --> 13:09.760
Mr. Bear?

13:13.560 --> 13:15.020
I'm glad to hear that.

13:18.860 --> 13:22.830
By the way, I don't know 
when your birthday is.

13:22.830 --> 13:24.920
Oh, my birthday?

13:25.360 --> 13:27.310
It's November 8th.

13:27.310 --> 13:28.160
Huh?

13:30.440 --> 13:31.900
Hey, Amane-kun.

13:31.900 --> 13:32.860
Huh?

13:32.860 --> 13:36.290
Didn't we already know each other 
pretty well by then?

13:36.290 --> 13:37.440
I guess so.

13:37.440 --> 13:39.530
Then why didn't you say anything?

13:39.530 --> 13:41.360
Well, you never asked.

13:41.360 --> 13:43.390
You didn't tell me either, remember?

13:43.390 --> 13:45.820
I didn't know until I saw your student ID.

13:47.720 --> 13:51.130
And we weren't as close then as we are now.

13:51.560 --> 13:55.500
If I told you my birthday, you might've 
thought, "what an arrogant jerk."

13:55.500 --> 13:56.600
Fine.

13:59.920 --> 14:03.210
Then we'll make sure 
to celebrate it this year.

14:07.310 --> 14:10.700
That sounds like a promise 
to stay together for a while.

14:17.510 --> 14:22.000
Well, you know I... 
don't dislike you, Amane-kun.

14:22.720 --> 14:25.710
I feel like I can relax when I'm with you.

14:26.170 --> 14:28.380
I'm glad. Thanks.

14:28.380 --> 14:30.930
I still have no other intentions, though!

14:33.890 --> 14:36.060
That much is very clear.

14:40.020 --> 14:44.980
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

14:56.980 --> 14:58.500
Hmm...

14:58.860 --> 15:01.000
Can I help you find something?

15:01.580 --> 15:08.170
Yeah, well... I'm having trouble finding 
a White Day gift that my friend won't hate.

15:08.170 --> 15:09.600
How do you mean?

15:09.600 --> 15:13.760
She isn't my girlfriend, but we still 
have a pretty close relationship.

15:14.630 --> 15:16.990
What I mean is, would a girl appreciate

15:16.990 --> 15:20.480
getting accessories or something from 
someone she doesn't like <i>that</i> way?

15:20.920 --> 15:26.020
If you're close friends, I think it's unlikely 
a gift like that would upset her.

15:26.510 --> 15:31.030
I could show you several items 
that are popular with girls now.

15:31.440 --> 15:32.650
Yes, please.

15:35.410 --> 15:36.330
Huh?!

15:36.810 --> 15:39.460
Wh-What did you do to your hair?

15:40.430 --> 15:42.620
Well, it is White Day.

15:42.620 --> 15:46.710
I thought I should... get a little dressed up.

15:49.290 --> 15:51.280
<i>Was this a mistake?</i>

15:51.280 --> 15:53.390
If it's too distracting, I'll go fix it.

15:53.390 --> 15:54.050
No!

15:54.440 --> 15:58.770
No, I don't think that. I'm just surprised.

16:00.260 --> 16:01.390
Okay.

16:09.670 --> 16:11.700
But really, if it's too distracting I'll fix it.

16:12.080 --> 16:15.050
N-No, you're fine like this.

16:15.480 --> 16:20.410
It's just, well, you almost look too cool.

16:20.410 --> 16:23.000
What do you mean "too cool"?

16:23.320 --> 16:26.810
I can relax with you 
because you're always so casual,

16:26.810 --> 16:28.920
but this isn't relaxing at all.

16:29.240 --> 16:30.760
Fine, I'll go change.

16:37.590 --> 16:39.720
Just stay like this.

16:42.490 --> 16:44.220
Oh! Here, your present.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.780
Don't expect too much.

16:47.340 --> 16:49.020
Thank you very much.

16:49.600 --> 16:51.110
May I open it?

16:51.680 --> 16:52.620
Yeah.

17:01.680 --> 17:05.290
You don't... like this sort of thing?

17:06.080 --> 17:09.290
No, I think it's cute.

17:09.780 --> 17:12.010
That's a relief.

17:12.010 --> 17:15.400
I thought it would look good on you. 
That's why I chose it.

17:16.230 --> 17:17.800
Thank you very much.

17:18.330 --> 17:20.890
Huh? There's something else?

17:21.200 --> 17:22.850
Ah, that?

17:23.320 --> 17:26.860
I d-didn't think that just 
one thing was enough.

17:26.860 --> 17:30.610
You help me out so much, 
so I wanted to grant you a wish or two.

17:30.610 --> 17:33.610
A do-anything-you-want ticket?

17:30.610 --> 17:33.610
<b>Do-Anything-You-Want</b>

17:30.610 --> 17:33.610
<b>Ticket</b>

17:35.670 --> 17:38.490
Did you draw this yourself, Amane-kun?

17:38.880 --> 17:41.370
Shut up! So what if I suck?

17:41.370 --> 17:44.950
No, I think it has character.

17:45.870 --> 17:48.120
<b>Do-Anything-You-Want</b>

17:45.870 --> 17:48.120
<b>Ticket</b>

17:52.010 --> 17:54.440
May I use it right now?

17:54.440 --> 17:55.300
For what?

17:58.450 --> 18:00.500
Please put this on me, Amane-kun.

18:01.840 --> 18:04.890
You don't need to use a ticket for that.

18:05.880 --> 18:07.480
But as you wish, Miss.

18:18.660 --> 18:20.940
Yeah, it suits you.

18:23.400 --> 18:24.950
Thank you very much.

18:34.980 --> 18:36.970
<i>I can't take it!</i>

18:37.760 --> 18:39.430
Did she like it?

18:39.760 --> 18:40.870
I guess.

18:41.470 --> 18:44.810
From the way you look, 
it must've been a success!

18:44.810 --> 18:49.140
Indeed, maybe she even 
rewarded you with a lovely smile?

18:58.360 --> 19:01.850
I <i>knew</i> it. I can tell 
you're steadily getting closer.

19:01.850 --> 19:03.070
Hmph.

19:03.070 --> 19:05.020
Hey, I'm happy for you, man!

19:05.020 --> 19:07.470
You're finally entering 
the springtime of your youth.

19:07.470 --> 19:08.830
That isn't what's happening.

19:08.830 --> 19:11.550
You don't know what she thinks, though.

19:11.550 --> 19:13.420
I know it isn't anything like that.

19:13.880 --> 19:16.490
Then as your friend, 
let me make a prediction.

19:16.490 --> 19:17.170
What now?

19:17.970 --> 19:19.340
Someday, you will change.

19:19.800 --> 19:22.300
I mean, I see signs of change already.

19:22.300 --> 19:24.380
Now you just need to take the first step.

19:25.660 --> 19:27.380
As if you know everything.

19:28.500 --> 19:31.080
How many years have we been friends anyway?

19:31.080 --> 19:32.650
It hasn't even been one yet.

19:33.080 --> 19:34.110
But still...

19:34.110 --> 19:34.860
Huh?

19:34.860 --> 19:39.490
I know you grumble about 
not being good enough for her,

19:39.490 --> 19:44.700
but when you talk like that, it's basically 
the same as admitting you have feelings.

19:46.490 --> 19:51.000
<b>Lids</b>

19:46.490 --> 19:51.000
<b>Straws</b>

19:46.800 --> 19:48.660
This fry's going up your nose!

19:48.660 --> 19:50.120
I beg your pardon.

19:56.450 --> 19:58.630
You're sure late today.

19:59.810 --> 20:01.880
<i>She looks like a young wife.</i>

20:02.240 --> 20:04.750
Yeah, I got some fries with Itsuki.

20:04.750 --> 20:05.890
Huh?

20:07.090 --> 20:09.140
Right before dinner?

20:09.140 --> 20:11.820
It's okay! I'll still eat it all.

20:11.820 --> 20:13.640
You'll gain weight...

20:13.640 --> 20:16.840
But then again, you're 
pretty skinny, Amane-kun,

20:16.840 --> 20:19.930
so it might not hurt 
to put on a little more weight.

20:19.930 --> 20:23.490
You, too. You could use 
a little more meat on your bones.

20:23.980 --> 20:25.230
I'm afraid you'll break.

20:25.230 --> 20:27.390
I'm not so weak that I'll break.

20:27.390 --> 20:28.860
Oh, yeah?

20:29.630 --> 20:32.000
Look at how skinny your arm is.

20:34.460 --> 20:36.040
Ah, sorry!

20:36.600 --> 20:39.340
I forgot that you don't like to be touched.

20:39.660 --> 20:44.340
N-No, I don't mind 
if you touch me, Amane-kun.

20:44.340 --> 20:45.260
Huh?

20:46.270 --> 20:46.840
Oh!

20:47.890 --> 20:52.350
Th-That doesn't mean 
I want you to touch me, okay?

20:52.350 --> 20:56.310
I just don't want any other boys touching me.

20:56.680 --> 20:58.310
O-Oh.

21:01.890 --> 21:03.710
O-Oh, right.

21:03.710 --> 21:05.720
You aren't wearing it today?

21:05.720 --> 21:06.580
Huh?

21:07.100 --> 21:09.480
Ah, I'm not trying to make you to put it on.

21:09.480 --> 21:14.550
If I wear it doing housework, it'll get 
in the way and my wrist will get sore.

21:14.970 --> 21:18.000
I want to take care of it, 
so I'll save it for days that I'm free.

21:18.630 --> 21:19.960
Makes sense.

21:20.870 --> 21:23.010
I'm really glad you like it, though.

21:23.010 --> 21:26.060
I do like it. I treasure them all.

21:26.560 --> 21:29.520
Mr. Bear, the key case, the bracelet...

21:29.520 --> 21:33.020
I am using up the hand cream, though.

21:34.740 --> 21:36.010
I'm gonna go change.

21:36.010 --> 21:37.230
Oh. Okay.

21:37.740 --> 21:39.730
See you soon, Amane-kun.

21:59.670 --> 22:03.660
<i>She really </i>is<i> like a young wife!</i>

22:05.390 --> 22:07.840
<i>Outer space is huge</i>

22:07.840 --> 22:10.190
<i>But only one of these planets</i>

22:10.190 --> 22:12.490
<i>Is our own blue planet, Earth</i>

22:12.490 --> 22:14.930
<i>And in that huge world</i>

22:14.930 --> 22:17.310
<i>A little message of love</i>

22:17.310 --> 22:19.650
<i>Is on its way to you</i>

22:19.650 --> 22:21.950
<i>Trying to make its way</i>

22:21.950 --> 22:24.840
<i>To you on that little island</i>

22:25.390 --> 22:27.790
<i>Ever since we first met</i>

22:27.790 --> 22:30.110
<i>There's a lot we've been through</i>

22:30.110 --> 22:32.560
<i>All these feelings I have</i>

22:32.560 --> 22:34.950
<i>Keep filling more letters, too</i>

22:34.950 --> 22:37.290
<i>Before you know it</i>

22:37.290 --> 22:39.580
<i>We’ll be singing together</i>

22:39.580 --> 22:41.900
<i>Sometimes powerful</i>

22:41.900 --> 22:44.220
<i>Sometimes heartbreaking</i>

22:44.220 --> 22:46.670
<i>When that song starts ringing out</i>

22:46.670 --> 22:49.050
<i>It will be heard far away</i>

22:49.050 --> 22:51.390
<i>And that sweet song</i>

22:51.390 --> 22:57.270
<i>Will change the world</i>

22:57.270 --> 23:01.070
<i>Listen, the one person</i>

23:01.070 --> 23:03.360
<i>Who’s dearest to you</i>

23:03.360 --> 23:06.690
<i>Is right next to you</i>

23:06.690 --> 23:10.430
<i>I just want to send this your way</i>

23:10.430 --> 23:12.780
<i>I'm hoping it will reach</i>

23:12.780 --> 23:16.120
<i>Please hear my love song</i>

23:16.120 --> 23:20.620
<i>Listen</i>

23:20.620 --> 23:25.420
<i>Listen</i>

23:25.420 --> 23:30.470
<i>Listen</i>

23:30.470 --> 23:34.200
<i>Please hear my love song</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
Next Time
